{
  "_what": "The task tray beside the Calendar. `lists` are the built-in lists every person has (they cannot be renamed or deleted; a person's own lists follow them): each has `match`, the test a task passes to be in it (calendar-task-views.mjs; `all` and `any` hold tests, a test names a task `field` and one of `is`, `in`, `empty`, `not_empty`, `today`, `today_or_before`), and `move_to`, the fields a task takes when it is moved into the list (absent: nothing moves into it). `display` is the Display menu: how the tray groups, sorts and which tasks it shows (`defaults`, kept as the person's own under `preference_key`). `quick_add` is how the words typed into the new-todo field are read: a word starting with `@` names a list or a time. `priorities` are the quick priority choices (their words are calendar-tasks.json priority_labels). `durations` are the duration chips on a task. `deadline_tones` colour a task's deadline by how near it is, the first row whose `within_days` holds. `menu` is the verbs a todo's menu offers, in order (`kind`: `run` does it, `choices` opens a short list, `panel` opens a small form). The keys that act on the tray are rows of the one keymap (keymap.json, scope `tasks`, verb `task-key`; `with.action` is what it does). Add a built-in list, a way to sort or a duration by adding a row.",
  "lists": [
    {
      "id": "all",
      "label": "All",
      "icon": "Layers",
      "builtin": true,
      "match": {
        "all": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "inbox",
      "label": "Inbox",
      "icon": "Inbox",
      "builtin": true,
      "match": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "collection_id",
            "empty": true
          },
          {
            "field": "smart_list",
            "empty": true
          },
          {
            "field": "starts_at",
            "empty": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "move_to": {
        "collection_id": null,
        "smart_list": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "today",
      "label": "Today",
      "icon": "CalendarCheck",
      "builtin": true,
      "match": {
        "any": [
          {
            "field": "starts_at",
            "today": true
          },
          {
            "field": "due",
            "today_or_before": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "other",
      "label": "Other",
      "icon": "Archive",
      "builtin": true,
      "match": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "collection_id",
            "empty": true
          },
          {
            "field": "smart_list",
            "is": "other"
          }
        ]
      },
      "move_to": {
        "collection_id": null,
        "smart_list": "other"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "email",
      "label": "Email",
      "icon": "Mail",
      "builtin": true,
      "match": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "collection_id",
            "empty": true
          },
          {
            "field": "smart_list",
            "is": "email"
          }
        ]
      },
      "move_to": {
        "collection_id": null,
        "smart_list": "email"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calendar",
      "label": "Calendar",
      "icon": "CalendarDays",
      "builtin": true,
      "match": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "collection_id",
            "empty": true
          },
          {
            "field": "smart_list",
            "is": "calendar"
          }
        ]
      },
      "move_to": {
        "collection_id": null,
        "smart_list": "calendar"
      }
    }
  ],
